# Generated edge artifacts must check out with LF on EVERY platform.
#
# scripts/build-edge-astrology.mjs and scripts/build-edge-tarot.mjs compare
# the committed artifact byte-for-byte (sha) against a fresh in-memory build,
# which is always LF. On Windows with core.autocrlf=true a text file is
# materialized CRLF and the strict compare fails on a perfectly clean
# checkout — the validator would demand a rebuild that changes nothing.
# Pinning eol=lf makes the checkout deterministic: the artifact that ships
# is the artifact that was generated.
*.generated.ts text eol=lf
